---

<section class="relative pt-10 pb-14 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <h1 class="text-[2.6rem] sm:text-7xl lg:text-[5.5rem] font-bold tracking-tight leading-[0.94] text-ink uppercase">
    Keep your{' '}
    <span class="bg-ink text-paper px-3 py-0.5 inline-block border-2 border-ink transform -rotate-1">
      .proto
    </span>{' '}
    files.
    <br />
    <span class="font-serif italic font-normal normal-case text-[#FF4F18] text-[3.1rem] sm:text-8xl lg:text-[6.2rem]">
      Upgrade the wire format.
    </span>
  </h1>

  <div class="mt-8 max-w-4xl space-y-5">
    <p class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-ink/90">
      <a
        href="https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/encoding/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="doc-link"
      >
        Protobuf
      </a>{' '}
      got schemas right, mostly, but the wire format from 2001 made two costly mistakes:{' '}
      <strong>it requires the schema just to decode values</strong>, and its byte-by-byte{' '}
      <a
        href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LEB128"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="doc-link"
      >
        LEB128 varints
      </a>{' '}
      are slow as hell.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-xl font-mono text-ink/90 leading-relaxed bg-[#FAF8F2] p-5 sm:p-6 border-2 border-ink shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#111] rounded-md">
      <strong>OmniBuf</strong> gives you <strong>all the benefits of Protobuf</strong> (your
      existing <code class="underline">.proto</code> files, compact binary payloads, schema
      evolution, and raw byte concatenation) in a wire format that is{' '}
      <strong>6x to 8x faster</strong> and <strong>inspectable without a schema</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3.5 pt-2 no-print">
      <a
        href="/how-it-works"
        class="os-btn px-5 py-3 bg-[#FF4F18] text-white font-mono font-bold text-sm sm:text-base rounded-md"
      >
        How It Works &rarr;
      </a>
      <a
        href="/benchmarks"
        class="os-btn px-5 py-3 bg-[#FAF8F2] text-ink font-mono font-bold text-sm sm:text-base rounded-md"
      >
        Benchmarks &amp; Comparisons &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SVG VISUALIZATION: ONE .PROTO FILE -> THREE ENCODINGS -->
